       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTREC1.
       AUTHOR. SYNTHETIC-CORPUS.
      * CATEGORY B: DATA HIERARCHY - DEEP MULTI-TIER CUSTOMER RECORD (01, 05, 10, 15)
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  CUSTOMER-MASTER-RECORD.
           05  CUSTOMER-HEADER.
               10  CUSTOMER-ID         PIC X(10) VALUE 'CUST009821'.
               10  ACCOUNT-STATUS      PIC X(2) VALUE 'AC'.
               10  MEMBERSHIP-TIER     PIC X(8) VALUE 'GOLD'.
           05  CUSTOMER-IDENTITY.
               10  INDIVIDUAL-NAME.
                   15  FIRST-NAME      PIC X(20) VALUE 'ALEXANDER'.
                   15  MIDDLE-INITIAL  PIC X(1) VALUE 'J'.
                   15  LAST-NAME       PIC X(25) VALUE 'HAMILTON'.
               10  TAX-IDENTIFIER      PIC X(11) VALUE '999-88-7777'.
           05  CONTACT-DETAILS.
               10  POSTAL-ADDRESS.
                   15  STREET-LINE-1   PIC X(35) VALUE '55 WALL STREET'.
                   15  STREET-LINE-2   PIC X(35) VALUE 'SUITE 400'.
                   15  CITY-NAME       PIC X(25) VALUE 'NEW YORK'.
                   15  STATE-CODE      PIC X(2) VALUE 'NY'.
                   15  POSTAL-CODE     PIC X(10) VALUE '10005-0001'.
               10  TELECOMMUNICATIONS.
                   15  PRIMARY-PHONE   PIC X(12) VALUE '212-555-0199'.
                   15  MOBILE-PHONE    PIC X(12) VALUE '917-555-0144'.
                   15  EMAIL-ADDRESS   PIC X(40) VALUE 'A.HAMILTON@TREASURY.GOV'.
           05  FINANCIAL-SUMMARY.
               10  TOTAL-BALANCE       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 000150245.50.
               10  CREDIT-LIMIT        PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0050000.00.
               10  LAST-ACTIVE-DATE    PIC 9(8) VALUE 20260901.

       01  CUSTOMER-DTO-EXPORT.
           05  OUT-SUMMARY-LINE        PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES.
           05  OUT-STATUS-DESC         PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-PROCESS-CUSTOMER.
           PERFORM 1000-MAP-STATUS-DESCRIPTION
           PERFORM 2000-FORMAT-EXPORT-SUMMARY
           GOBACK.

       1000-MAP-STATUS-DESCRIPTION.
           IF ACCOUNT-STATUS = 'AC'
               MOVE 'ACTIVE IN GOOD STANDING' TO OUT-STATUS-DESC
           ELSE
               IF ACCOUNT-STATUS = 'SU'
                   MOVE 'SUSPENDED PENDING DOCS' TO OUT-STATUS-DESC
               ELSE
                   MOVE 'CLOSED OR INACTIVE' TO OUT-STATUS-DESC
               END-IF
           END-IF.

       2000-FORMAT-EXPORT-SUMMARY.
           IF TOTAL-BALANCE > CREDIT-LIMIT
               MOVE 'WARNING: CUSTOMER BALANCE EXCEEDS CREDIT LIMIT' TO OUT-SUMMARY-LINE
           ELSE
               MOVE 'CUSTOMER PROFILE VALIDATED AND SYNCED' TO OUT-SUMMARY-LINE
           END-IF.
